# deny everything and then allow only what the Dockerfile actually COPYs, which is more
# robust than listing things to exclude, because `index.md`, `.DS_Store` and anything else
# added later stays out of the build context without this file having to be updated
#
# but of course a new COPY source has to be allowed here, otherwise the build will fail
# with a "file not found" error
*

!config
!crontab
!entrypoint.sh
!healthcheck.sh
!kinocheck-trailers.py
!sshd_config.template
!ydl.sh
